{#
/**
 * @file
 * The site-branding block — deliberately renders nothing.
 *
 * The site-masthead component renders the wordmark itself: centred between the
 * two navigation groups, with its brass rules and wide tracking. That
 * composition *is* the design, and the branding block cannot produce it.
 * Leaving the block to render as well printed the site name a second time,
 * beside the wordmark, with Drupal's default logo above it.
 *
 * Suppressed here rather than in hook_preprocess_page(): blocks in the header
 * region reach preprocess as `#lazy_builder` placeholders that carry no
 * `#plugin_id` yet, so they cannot be identified and unset there.
 *
 * If you would rather the block were simply not placed, unplace it at
 * /admin/structure/block — this template makes it harmless either way.
 *
 * Available variables (all unused, listed for whoever restores this):
 * - site_logo: Logo for site as defined in Appearance or theme settings.
 * - site_name: Name for site as defined in Site information settings.
 * - site_slogan: Slogan for site as defined in Site information settings.
 *
 * @see components/site-masthead/site-masthead.twig
 */
#}
